    <string name="rationale_title">Your health data stays here</string>
    <string name="rationale_body">Healthy reads your health and fitness data from Health Connect and shows it on one dashboard. It reads only — it never writes anything back. Nothing is uploaded, there is no account, no cloud and no analytics: the data never leaves this phone.</string>

